### **D. Notebook checking history**

The Notebook Checking Report is a particularly important part of the system.

It has been implemented and reported as committed, with whole-class entry, history and CSV export.

Its structure is:

| Parameter        | Information recorded                            |
| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Date             | Date of notebook checking                       |
| Chapter number   | Chapter being checked                           |
| Chapter name     | Optional descriptive name                       |
